msgstr "Úsáid an bloc Currency Kit san eagarthóir Gutenberg le haghaidh eagarthóireacht fhisiciúil"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Copy the embed code to use on external websites"
msgstr "Cóipeáil an cód embed le húsáid ar shuímh ghréasáin sheachtracha"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Frequently Asked Questions"
msgstr "Ceisteanna a Chuirtear Go Minic"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "How do I add a currency converter to my page?"
msgstr "Conas a chuirim comhoiriúnóir airgeadra ar mo leathanach?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Use the shortcode [currencywiki_converter] or add the Currency Kit block in the Gutenberg editor."
msgstr "Úsáid an shortcode [currencywiki_converter] nó cuir an bloc Currency Kit san eagarthóir Gutenberg."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Can I customize the widget colors?"
msgstr "An féidir liom dathanna an widget a shaincheapadh?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Yes! Go to Currency Kit → Dashboard and select your preferred accent color from the color palette."
msgstr "Sea! Téigh chuig Currency Kit → Painéal Rialaithe agus roghnaigh do dhath accent is fearr ón phailéad dathanna."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "How often are exchange rates updated?"
msgstr "Cén minic a nuashonraítear na rátaí malairte?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Exchange rates are updated in real-time from Currency.Wiki API."
msgstr "Nuashonraítear na rátaí malairte i bhfíor-am ó API Currency.Wiki."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Need More Help?"
msgstr "Teastaíonn Tuilleadh Cabhair?"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Contact our support team or visit our documentation for more information."
msgstr "Déan teagmháil lenár bhfoireann tacaíochta nó tabhair cuairt ar ár ndoiciméadacht le haghaidh tuilleadh eolais."

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Get Support"
msgstr "Faigh Tacaíocht"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Display currency converter on your sidebar. (Legacy V2 widget - consider using the Gutenberg block instead)"
msgstr "Taispeáin comhoiriúnóir airgeadra ar do thaobh. (Widget Oidhreachta V2 - smaoinigh ar úsáid an bloc Gutenberg in ionad é)"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Currency Converter Widget (Legacy)"
msgstr "Widget Comhoiriúnóra Airgeadra (Oidhreachta)"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "Legacy Widget"
msgstr "Widget Oidhreachta"

#: currency-converter-widget.php
msgid "This is a legacy V2 widget. For more features and better customization, use the new Currency Converter block in the Gutenberg editor."
msgstr "Is widget Oidhreachta V2 é seo. Le haghaidh níos mó gnéithe agus níos fearr saincheaptha, bain úsáid as an bloc Comhoiriúnóra Airgeadra nua san eagarthóir Gutenberg."

